  "description": "Kwon Joonhyuk, the class president infamous for his terrible personality, gets caught up with Min Dohyun at the freshman party. What starts as a seemingly harmless gathering takes a dark turn when Joonhyuk wakes up in Dohyun’s place, his hands tied to a bedframe. Now, it’s time to uncover the perfect student’s secret little hobby.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Blühen's Hageukasang (하극상) Short Story Collection or Downfall Collection in English.*",
